---
name: Art Generator
description: Illustration generation for MyPhonicsBooks via ONE persistent chat session per book (Vertex Gemini image chat). Establish character/setting references once, then describe each scene in 2-3 sentences; the conversation history carries consistency. Repairs are conversational nudges. Won the 2026-07-25 three-way bake-off against both the one-shot star pipeline and the continuity-chain pipeline.
